\b PrimEx Smart Save - Staff Pilot\b0\par\par
This installer configures PrimEx Smart Save for the signed-in Windows user. It installs the application and its .NET runtime, creates shortcuts and adds automatic launch at user sign-in.\par\par
After installation, open PrimEx Smart Save from the desktop shortcut. Select the local folders to watch and the authorized company server root. Monitoring stays off until you explicitly apply your choices. Existing documents are not scanned or moved automatically.\par\par
The application runs in the notification area. Closing its main window hides it. Exit stops it; the next sign-in starts it again if startup remains enabled. This version does not automatically recover from a process crash.\par\par
This is a pilot release. Document guidance happens after files are saved and unlocked in the selected folders. Office before-save interception is not implemented. Uninstall retains settings, pending-operation records and user documents.\par\par
Use this installer only through your organization's approved deployment process. No company-wide deployment or browser extension installation is performed by opening this package.\par
